# Fuzz cases and finding reproducers are exact wire BYTES. Some are deliberately not
# UTF-8, start with a byte-order mark, or end in CR, LF or NUL; both implementations
# replay them from the bytes, and the corpus manifest pins a SHA-384 of each. Git must
# never normalize line endings in them or treat them as text to merge.
conformance/fuzz/cases/*  binary
sim/findings/*.json       -text
sim/findings/*.bin        binary
